That gives you a very clean story:

Agent = reasoning/orchestration

Skill = repeatable A&A methodology

MCP = access to systems/tools

Azure = authoritative technical state

Evidence store = durable provenance

Website = human consumable result

That architecture is much easier to explain than the original multi-agent system.

